00:14:03,460 --> 00:14:10,500
situations. Absolutely. So Emma, what are we talking about today? Today's topic is extremely

328
00:14:10,500 --> 00:14:16,180
practical and powerful. We're going to learn how to write a professional email in business

329
00:14:16,180 --> 00:14:22,260
English. Oh, I love this topic. Writing emails is something almost everyone does every day,

330
00:14:22,260 --> 00:14:28,180
but doing it professionally is a real skill. Exactly. Whether you're applying for a job,

331
00:14:28,180 --> 00:14:33,700
communicating with your boss, contacting clients, or even just asking for information,

332
00:14:33,700 --> 00:14:37,780
knowing how to write a professional email can make a huge difference.

